{"title":"","link":"https://bradbarrish.com/2025/06/14/i-took-the-kids-to.html","date":1749938086000,"content":"<p>I took the kids to the <a href=\"https://www.nokings.org/\">No Kings</a> protest in Culver City. It was great to see friends and so many people turn out. What’s happening, especially in Los Angeles, is absolutely terrible and  scary. Feels like it’s going to get worse before it gets better.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.uploads.micro.blog/4832/2025/ee25f9d25c.jpg\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" /><img src=\"https://cdn.uploads.micro.blog/4832/2025/c64456e0a9.jpg\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" /><img src=\"https://cdn.uploads.micro.blog/4832/2025/fe54ec67de.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" /></p>","author":"","siteTitle":"Brad Barrish","siteHash":"91e49f51884b2947fac16e947ba7e59fe5a24800befb4760d388da1b057f4f23","entryHash":"ece64176254700ce1a2baded5a2b494488cf59861682d71b2cae9a86be23826d","category":"Sites"}